# .dockerignore for the monorepo root (this is the Docker build context
# used by apps/api/Dockerfile — see the `docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .`
# instructions there).
#
# IMPORTANT: keep every packages/shared/** rule scoped so it can never
# match packages/shared itself — apps/api's Docker build needs that
# package's source to compile it. The explicit `!packages/shared/**`
# re-inclusions below exist specifically to survive edits to the generic
# patterns above them.

# --- Other apps: not part of the API image, biggest context savings ---
apps/web
apps/mobile

# --- VCS / editor / OS cruft ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.DS_Store

# --- Dependencies & build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image) ---
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Env files & secrets: never bake these into an image layer ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Docs, logs, local dev DB ---
*.md
*.log
**/*.log
apps/api/prisma/dev.db

# --- Safety net: packages/shared must always survive the rules above ---
!packages/shared
!packages/shared/**
!packages/shared/package.json
# ...but still skip its own node_modules/build output — those get
# reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image, same as everywhere else.
packages/shared/node_modules
packages/shared/dist
packages/shared/*.tsbuildinfo
